# Presets (src/ui/SettingsIO.h) now resolve to the repo-root presets/
# directory regardless of launch method (see EngineUi.cpp's PresetsDir())
# and are tracked, not ignored -- they're tuned looks worth keeping, the
# same reasoning applies to the deliberately-hand-curated presets/ files
# already in the repo. The old settings/ path (CWD-relative, so it split
# into build/settings/ vs. <root>/settings/ depending on how the exe was
# launched) is dead now that nothing writes there, but still ignored in
# case a stray copy lingers on disk from before this change.
settings/
